sequenceDiagram
    actor Visitor
    participant Web
    participant API
    participant Router
    participant LangGraph
    participant Store
    participant Model

    Visitor->>Web: How do I submit a timesheet?
    Web->>API: POST /public/chat
    API->>Router: Job, document, or both?
    Router-->>API: Document question
    API->>LangGraph: invoke retrieve then draft
    LangGraph->>Store: Sections for careers visitors
    Store-->>LangGraph: Timesheet procedure excerpt
    LangGraph->>Model: Question plus that excerpt only
    Model-->>LangGraph: Two to four sentences
    LangGraph-->>API: Answer and sources
    API-->>Web: No job cards
    Web-->>Visitor: The answer
